OL,3,GNEWSAResidents' fears over 'monster'
OL,4,Adata centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 100 people attended a
OL,7,Fconsultation for plans for a large data
OL,8,Fcentre on green belt land in Cheshire.
OL,10,FInnova held the drop-in session at High
OL,11,FLegh Village Hall near Lymm on
OL,12,FWednesday evening to discuss plans to
OL,13,Fbuild a 60-hectare data centre in
OL,14,FLittle Bollington.
OL,16,FLocal resident Mike Reed, who is
OL,17,Fhelping to organise local opposition to
OL,18,Fthe plan, described it as a "massive
OL,19,Fgreat industrial monster" and said
OL,20,Flocals left the meeting with "deep
OL,21,Fanxiety" over the potential impact on
OL,22,Ftheir homes, businesses and wildlife.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
